      "summary": "Adds a note, with an optional file, to a task found by its code.",
      "description": "Send a multipart form with the note's text as `note` and, optionally, a `file` to attach. The path takes the task's `code`. The new note comes back under `note`, with its `id`.",
      "warning": "**This call currently returns `409`.** Adding a note to a task fails on the API, so no task note can be created yet.",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "task_code",
          "in": "path",
          "required": true,
          "description": "The task's `code`. The note routes look the task up by its code, and a `wt_` id returns `404`.",
